\vspace{8pt}

\section*{Summary}
\begin{itemize}[leftmargin=*, label=$\bullet$, itemsep=0pt, parsep=4pt]
\item Senior Growth Product Manager with 8+ years improving conversion, activation, and retention across B2C e-commerce and digital products. Redesigned checkout funnels and mobile purchase experiences for Natura \& Co, scaling across 4 countries. Designs structured experimentation programs and habit-forming mechanics to increase long-term retention in mobile environments.
\end{itemize}

\vspace{2pt}

\section*{Experience}

\noindent\textbf{Postscript}, Senior Product Manager — Growth \& AI \hfill Jul 2024 – Apr 2026, Remote
\begin{itemize}[leftmargin=*, label=$\bullet$, itemsep=4pt, parsep=0pt]
\item Led product development for an AI-powered message optimization engine, designing habit-forming notification loops that increased subscriber engagement while maintaining list health. Used predictive analytics and generative AI to test hundreds of variants per automation, driving a 28\% increase in earnings-per-message for Shopify merchants through continuous model learning.
\item Redesigned subscriber acquisition for Shopify merchants around SMS compliance, implementing one-tap mobile opt-in. Increased opt-in conversion by 32\% and reduced acquisition cost by 18\% through repositioned incentive timing and simplified consent language.
\item Built analytics instrumentation to measure SMS program health across 18,000+ merchant accounts, establishing earnings-per-message and click-through rate as primary KPIs. Identified engagement decay patterns unique to SMS versus email channels, translating insights into re-engagement automation roadmap priorities presented to leadership.
\end{itemize}

\vspace{6pt}

\noindent\textbf{Forvia Hella}, Senior Product Manager \hfill Jul 2022 – Jan 2024, Berlin
\begin{itemize}[leftmargin=*, label=$\bullet$, itemsep=5pt, parsep=0pt]
\item Managed product roadmap for HELLA B2B e-commerce (60,000+ workshops), coordinating cross-functional teams across engineering, data, and commercial teams to integrate Faurecia product portfolio within 12-month timeline as part of FORVIA's €400M post-merger synergy program. Enabled €12M+ Year 1 cross-sell revenue through unified catalog and improved product discoverability.

\item Redesigned checkout flow and implemented Userlane digital adoption tools to improve order experience. Reduced order completion time by 35\%, increased self-service adoption by 40\%, and improved NPS by 22 points through streamlined product catalog navigation and multi-item cart optimization.
\end{itemize}

\vspace{6pt}

\noindent\textbf{Accenture Brasil}, Senior Product Manager \hfill Feb 2020 – Apr 2022, São Paulo, Brazil

\vspace{6pt}

\noindent\textit{E-Commerce Growth \& LatAm Expansion (Client: Natura \& Co):} Embedded as product manager for Brazil e-commerce optimization, then regional rollout.


\begin{itemize}[leftmargin=*, label=$\bullet$, itemsep=2pt, parsep=0pt]
\item Managed end-to-end checkout flow redesign (cart → payment → order confirmation), partnering with engineering, UX, and data analytics teams through agile sprint cycles.

\item Increased conversion rate by 45\% and reduced cart abandonment by 15\% through iterative A/B testing and UX optimization, implementing simplified checkout flows, Google Maps API address autocomplete, and expanded payment methods. Improved customer satisfaction by 16 points through mobile-optimized experience and streamlined multi-item ordering.

\item Managed 4-country LatAm rollout (Argentina, Colombia, Chile, Mexico) within 6-month timeline, coordinating country-specific teams on shared platform roadmap and prioritizing localization requirements (payments, language, regulatory compliance). Achieved 90\%+ feature parity and reduced time-to-market for subsequent launches by 35\% through standardized playbooks, enabling 40\%+ addressable market expansion.
\end{itemize}

\vspace{6pt}

\noindent\textbf{C\&A Brasil}, Senior Product Manager \hfill Mar 2018 – Jan 2020, São Paulo, Brazil
\begin{itemize}[leftmargin=*, label=$\bullet$, itemsep=5pt, parsep=0pt]
\item Joined as PM focused on e-commerce checkout optimization for C\&A Brasil. Led funnel analysis using Google Analytics and heatmaps, coordinated with engineering and UX teams through agile sprints, and increased conversion rate by 28\% and reduced cart abandonment by 18\% through mobile-optimized redesign, payment expansion, and data-driven experimentation.

\item Promoted to Senior PM after 18 months, assuming ownership of Checkout \& Payments vertical. Supported Salesforce Marketing Cloud CRM integration and WhatsApp Business API pilot for order notifications and customer service, expanding scope from checkout optimization to full customer journey.
\end{itemize}

\vspace{8pt}

\noindent\textbf{Mollis}, Founder \hfill 2016 – 2017, São Paulo, Brazil
\begin{itemize}[leftmargin=*, label=$\bullet$, itemsep=5pt, parsep=0pt]
\item Founded Mollis, a solo digital agency, building e-commerce solutions and digital products for 6-8 SMBs while completing university degree. Managed client discovery, vendor coordination, and delivery, establishing foundational product management skills.
\end{itemize}

\vspace{6pt}

\section*{Skills \& Tools}
\begin{itemize}[leftmargin=*, label=$\bullet$, itemsep=3pt, parsep=0pt]
\item \textbf{Product:} Experimentation Frameworks, A/B Testing, Funnel \& Cohort Analysis, Conversion Rate Optimisation, Product-Led Growth, Activation \& Onboarding, Roadmap Prioritisation, OKRs, Go-to-Market Planning
\item \textbf{Analytics:} SQL, Python, GA4, Amplitude, Mixpanel, FullStory, Power BI, Tableau
\item \textbf{Tools:} Jira, Linear, Productboard, Notion, Figma, Zapier, Retool, n8n, PostHog, Cursor
\item \textbf{Rapid Prototyping \& Automation:} Figma, Claude Code, Cursor, MCP, Supabase
\item \textbf{AI \& ML:} LLM Evaluation, Prompt Engineering, Voice AI, Agentic Workflows
\item \textbf{Platforms \& APIs:} REST APIs, Third-Party Integrations, IVR Voice Platforms, VTEX, Payment Gateways, Google Maps API, WhatsApp Business API
\end{itemize}

\vspace{6pt}

\section*{Certifications}
\begin{itemize}[leftmargin=*, label=$\bullet$, itemsep=2pt, parsep=0pt]
\item 2026 -- Introduction to Subagents, Anthropic
\item 2026 -- Claude Code in Action, Anthropic
\item 2026 -- AI Fluency Framework \& Foundations, Anthropic
\item 2021 -- Certified Scrum Product Owner\textregistered{}, Scrum Alliance
\item 2020 – Enterprise Design Thinking: Team Essentials for AI, IBM
\item 2020 – Design Sprint Masterclass, AJ\&Smart
